  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Successful path",
      "items": [
        "The student submits; auth(\"st\") and placement_access pass",
        "service.submit moves draft → submitted and the router commits slot, audit row, outbox row and a pending similarity check together",
        "The deliver job sends report.submitted to the academic supervisor by email and web push",
        "The assigned supervisor accepts; the student is told by the same outbox"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Approval and blocked paths",
      "items": [
        "Only the placement's academic supervisor can accept or request a revision; a revision needs a comment (422 COMMENT_REQUIRED)",
        "Gate: 401 UNAUTHENTICATED / SESSION_EXPIRED, 403 CONSENT_REQUIRED, VERIFICATION_REQUIRED, FORBIDDEN",
        "Submit: 403 not your placement, 409 INVALID_TRANSITION, SLOT_CLOSED, CYCLE_CLOSED, NOTHING_TO_SUBMIT, TOO_MANY_ATTACHMENTS, 422 REQUIRED_FIELDS_MISSING, MAIN_DOCUMENT_REQUIRED",
        "A blocked request raises before db.commit(), so nothing is saved"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Retry paths",
      "items": [
        "Revision: revision_requested → submit is an allowed transition, creating a new version",
        "Similarity: similarity_retry (every 5 min) re-runs checks pending over 5 minutes, and failed ones with fewer than 3 attempts",
        "Email: retried by the deliver job up to 5 attempts; push is tried once and is skipped without VAPID keys or a subscription"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "Evidence",
      "items": [
        "Audit entries are written in the same transaction as the change (submit, accept, revision)",
        "similarity_checks keeps status, attempts, error, score and model version; a flag is advisory only",
        "Every job run records a job_runs row; /health?deep=true reports the last scheduler run and the model"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "slate",
      "title": "How the lanes map",
      "items": [
        "InternSync has no AI agent tool-call loop; this is the closest real loop in the code",
        "\"Agent runtime\" is the API request handling and \"tool execution\" the in-process background work"
      ]
    }
  ]
}